sequenceDiagram
    participant REG as Registrar
    participant SMT as Sparse Merkle Tree
    participant CONTRACT as LandRegistry.sol

    Note over REG,CONTRACT: Parcel A registered first
    REG->>SMT: insertCell(cells_A)
    SMT-->>REG: witnesses, newRoot_A
    REG->>CONTRACT: registerParcel(proof_A, [0, newRoot_A, commit_A])
    CONTRACT-->>REG: token 1 minted, root = newRoot_A

    Note over REG,SMT: Parcel B attempted (overlaps A)
    REG->>SMT: findCell(cells_B)
    SMT-->>REG: overlap detected (cell shared with A)
    REG-->>REG: status = overlap, stop (no proof generated)

    Note over REG,CONTRACT: Parcel C registered (no overlap with A)
    REG->>SMT: insertCell(cells_C)
    SMT-->>REG: witnesses, newRoot_C
    REG->>CONTRACT: registerParcel(proof_C, [newRoot_A, newRoot_C, commit_C])
    CONTRACT-->>REG: token 2 minted, root = newRoot_C
